        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You learn <strong>two</strong> kidō of your choice at 1st level, and one additional kidō at 5th, 9th, 13th and 17th level &mdash; <strong>six chosen kidō</strong> in total, on top of your free cantrip <strong>Sh&#333;</strong>.</p><p>You are the only Lineage that <em>chooses</em>: a Hollow and a Quincy each get exactly two fixed kidō native to what they are.</p><hr /><p><em>Six known focus effects is the top of the range Pathfinder permits without a spell list, and this is the Lineage that actually reaches it.</em></p>"
        },
